WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:02,140
Mr. Zhang, tell me straight away

2
00:00:03,140 --> 00:00:05,140
Mr. Chen is a cheerful person

3
00:00:06,140 --> 00:00:07,140
If it's still the same thing

4
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:08,140
No need to mention it again

5
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:10,140
You already thanked me

6
00:00:10,140 --> 00:00:12,720
I didn’t come here today for security reasons

7
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:14,720
I want to ask you a favor

8
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:15,750
What are you busy with?

9
00:00:15,750 --> 00:00:16,750
protect my daughter

10
00:00:16,750 --> 00:00:18,750
Find a bodyguard

11
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:19,750
Mr. Zhang, with your financial resources

12
00:00:19,750 --> 00:00:21,750
It’s not difficult to find a few professional bodyguards

13
00:00:21,750 --> 00:00:22,750
No need to look for me

14
00:00:22,750 --> 00:00:24,750
Money can indeed solve a lot of things

15
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:26,820
But this time

16
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:28,820
My daughter was still kidnapped

17
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:30,710
If you hadn't taken action

18
00:00:31,710 --> 00:00:32,710
The consequences are disastrous

19
00:00:33,710 --> 00:00:35,710
I, Zhang Liansheng, started from scratch

20
00:00:35,710 --> 00:00:37,840
It will definitely offend some people

21
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:39,840
I've never been afraid of anything in my life

22
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:40,840
Only this daughter

23
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:41,840
It's my weakness

24
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:43,840
Now that I know someone is threatening

25
00:00:43,840 --> 00:00:47,340
Why not arrange protection in advance

26
00:00:47,340 --> 00:00:49,340
arranged

27
00:00:49,340 --> 00:00:50,400
Impossible

28
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:52,400
This girl has been around since she was eighteen years old

29
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:53,400
Just move out and live alone

30
00:00:53,400 --> 00:00:54,400
The driver doesn't want it

31
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:55,400
The nanny doesn’t want it

32
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:57,430
Not to mention bodyguards

33
00:00:57,430 --> 00:01:00,460
What bothers him most is that someone is following him to take care of him.

34
00:01:00,460 --> 00:01:02,530
All the people he sent were driven away by him

35
00:01:02,530 --> 00:01:03,720
Then it will be useful to me

36
00:01:03,720 --> 00:01:05,720
I have been in business for decades

37
00:01:05,720 --> 00:01:06,720
Don't dare to say anything else

38
00:01:06,720 --> 00:01:08,720
Seems a little distant from people

39
00:01:08,720 --> 00:01:11,010
I also know your skills

40
00:01:11,010 --> 00:01:12,010
So I can trust you

41
00:01:12,010 --> 00:01:14,390
I have received Mr. Zhang’s trust.

42
00:01:14,390 --> 00:01:16,650
But I won't work as a bodyguard for a private person.

43
00:01:16,650 --> 00:01:20,310
What if it's not a bodyguard?

44
00:01:20,310 --> 00:01:21,310
I would like to invite you to work in the group

45
00:01:21,310 --> 00:01:23,310
Served as assistant to the general manager

46
00:01:23,310 --> 00:01:24,500
who is the general manager

47
00:01:24,500 --> 00:01:25,500
my daughter

48
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:26,500
Change the name

49
00:01:26,500 --> 00:01:27,500
Still a bodyguard

50
00:01:27,500 --> 00:01:29,500
But you don’t have to listen to any private money transfers

51
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:32,500
I just want to ensure the safety of the general manager. Sorry.

52
00:01:32,500 --> 00:01:34,500
Now that Mr. Chen has made up his mind

53
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:35,500
I don't force anyone to do anything

54
00:01:35,500 --> 00:01:38,950
By the way, this is Mr. Chen

55
00:01:38,950 --> 00:01:43,290
What does this tuition income mean?
